# Register the SQLite parent-directory creator as an EnvironmentPostProcessor so it
# runs before any bean (DataSource/EntityManagerFactory) is created. Spring Boot 3.x
# still loads EnvironmentPostProcessors from spring.factories (not the .imports file,
# which is reserved for AutoConfigurations).
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
dev.runner.agent.config.SqliteDirEnvironmentPostProcessor